# Source is LF in both trees; do not let autocrlf rewrite it on checkout.
# A CRLF/LF flip makes a one-line change look like a whole-file rewrite, and
# it has already caused confusion once on this project.
*.py   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.bat  text eol=lf
*.txt  -text

# Generated artifacts: keep byte-exact. results/*.json are natively CRLF
# (json.dump on Windows) and their bytes are hashed in certificates, so no
# conversion of any kind.
*.json  -text
*.jsonl -text
*.npz   binary
